<title>USA: CIBCR leading inflation index 105.8 March-sources.</title>
<headline>CIBCR leading inflation index 105.8 March-sources.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Center for International Business Cycle Research (CIBCR) leading inflation index (LII) was expected to read 105.8 in March versus a revised 105.2 in February, sources said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
